e of its type inside its range and values, every required field, and no key the schema lacks (node x describe <kind> lists the fields)',\n  values: {\n    where: 'weapon \"weapon:pistol-new-0\"',\n    problems: 'unknown key \"description\"'\n  }\n}\n\nNode.js v24.22.1\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
