{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_148","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/ui/style.css');s=p.read_text()+\\\"\\\\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:Impact,'DejaVu Sans Condensed','Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:800}.auction-slip h2{font-size:4.6vh;letter-spacing:-.02em}.title-copy h1{font-weight:900}\\\\n\\\";p.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/scenery.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"  const colliders:ColliderSpec[]=[];\\\", \\\"  const colliders:ColliderSpec[]=[];\\\\n  for(const [x,z] of [[540,660],[590,650],[600,700],[700,680],[500,620],[550,715],[645,685]])put(w,'thorn-1',x,z);\\\\n  for(const site of PLACES)for(let k=0;k<12;k++){const a=k*2.4,x=site.x+Math.sin(a)*(site.radius+12),z=site.z+Math.cos(a)*(site.radius+12);if(c.fuel[cellAt(x,z)]&&roadDistance(x,z)>5)c.grass[cellAt(x,z)]=put(w,'grass',x,z);}\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/story.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('placeActor, actOn, setDaytime','placeActor, actOn, setDaytime, handOff')\ns=s.replace(\\\"actOn(w,b.entity,a=>a.play('action:field-mercy-plea'));\\\", \\\"handOff(w,b.entity,{dead:true});\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/health.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('actOn, placeActor, removeActor','actOn, placeActor, removeActor, standUp, handOff')\ns=s.replace(\\\"b.fallen=0;b.debt=Math.max(-3,b.debt-1);mark(w,'buddy saved');\\\", \\\"b.fallen=0;b.debt=Math.max(-3,b.debt-1);standUp(w,b.entity);mark(w,'buddy saved');\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"b.alive=false;b.fallen=0;mark(w,'buddy death');say\\\", \\\"b.alive=false;b.fallen=0;handOff(w,b.entity,{dead:true});mark(w,'buddy death');say\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Browser milestone\n- The bundled game now boots with \"'`__engine.ready === true` and no engine or page errors on software WebGPU.\n- Root cause of GPU startup stalls was the engine eagerly warming a batch for every gun part/tier/pose. Authored gun geometry is now assembled into one native prop batch per variant, preserving all twelve silhouettes and reload poses while reducing warm-up memory. No engine changes.\n- Inspected the title PNG: actual terrain/fire/trees render under the title UI. Fixed auction-slip typography overflow and added nearby grass/thorn silhouettes.\n- First sim suite: 8 passed / 7 failed; shared undefined NPC aim caused several failures. Corrected it, vehicle exit re-entry, and moved the prologue fire away from the mandatory healing lesson. Second run is in progress.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_148","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/ui/style.css');s=p.read_text()+\\\"\\\\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:Impact,'DejaVu Sans Condensed','Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:800}.auction-slip h2{font-size:4.6vh;letter-spacing:-.02em}.title-copy h1{font-weight:900}\\\\n\\\";p.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/scenery.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"  const colliders:ColliderSpec[]=[];\\\", \\\"  const colliders:ColliderSpec[]=[];\\\\n  for(const [x,z] of [[540,660],[590,650],[600,700],[700,680],[500,620],[550,715],[645,685]])put(w,'thorn-1',x,z);\\\\n  for(const site of PLACES)for(let k=0;k<12;k++){const a=k*2.4,x=site.x+Math.sin(a)*(site.radius+12),z=site.z+Math.cos(a)*(site.radius+12);if(c.fuel[cellAt(x,z)]&&roadDistance(x,z)>5)c.grass[cellAt(x,z)]=put(w,'grass',x,z);}\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/story.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('placeActor, actOn, setDaytime','placeActor, actOn, setDaytime, handOff')\ns=s.replace(\\\"actOn(w,b.entity,a=>a.play('action:field-mercy-plea'));\\\", \\\"handOff(w,b.entity,{dead:true});\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/health.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('actOn, placeActor, removeActor','actOn, placeActor, removeActor, standUp, handOff')\ns=s.replace(\\\"b.fallen=0;b.debt=Math.max(-3,b.debt-1);mark(w,'buddy saved');\\\", \\\"b.fallen=0;b.debt=Math.max(-3,b.debt-1);standUp(w,b.entity);mark(w,'buddy saved');\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"b.alive=false;b.fallen=0;mark(w,'buddy death');say\\\", \\\"b.alive=false;b.fallen=0;handOff(w,b.entity,{dead:true});mark(w,'buddy death');say\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Browser milestone\n- The bundled game now boots with \"'`__engine.ready === true` and no engine or page errors on software WebGPU.\n- Root cause of GPU startup stalls was the engine eagerly warming a batch for every gun part/tier/pose. Authored gun geometry is now assembled into one native prop batch per variant, preserving all twelve silhouettes and reload poses while reducing warm-up memory. No engine changes.\n- Inspected the title PNG: actual terrain/fire/trees render under the title UI. Fixed auction-slip typography overflow and added nearby grass/thorn silhouettes.\n- First sim suite: 8 passed / 7 failed; shared undefined NPC aim caused several failures. Corrected it, vehicle exit re-entry, and moved the prologue fire away from the mandatory healing lesson. Second run is in progress.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
