ace(\\\"    ctx.me = 0;\\\\n    ctx.seed++;\\\", \\\"    if(mode==='contract')for(const [key,v]of Object.entries(contractPreset()))e.set(key,v);\\\\n    ctx.me = 0;\\\\n    ctx.seed++;\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"    ctx.inHub = true;\\\\n    ctx.me = net.me;\\\", \\\"    ctx.inHub = true;\\\\n    ctx.me = net.me;ended=false;\\\\n    for(const [key,v] of Object.entries(contractPreset(net.players.length,net.me)))e.set(key,v);\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/boot.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"import { world } from './scenes/world';\\\", \\\"import { world } from './scenes/world';\\\\nimport {contractPreset} from './scenes/preset';\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"settings: { 'game.mode': 'contract', 'game.seats': info.players.length, 'game.me': -1, 'game.detail': 0.08 },\\\", \\\"settings: contractPreset(info.players.length,-1),\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"  } else if (navigator.gpu) {\\\", \\\"  } else if (navigator.gpu) {\\\\n    if(info)for(const [key,v]of Object.entries(contractPreset(info.players.length,info.me)))search.set(key,String(v));\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nset -e\nnode --import tsx out/golden.mts\nnode scripts/bundle.mjs\nNODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=1800 node tests/game/verify.mjs page\"","aggregated_output":"Stopping obsolete browser driver PID 1322375\nStopping obsolete browser driver PID 1322711\n85d6a41d88cc2fd0\n","exit_code":143,"status":"failed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_210","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/boot.ts');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace(\\\"    if (\"'!search.has('\"'game.detail')) {\\\\n      let fallback = true;\\\", \\\"    {\\\\n      let fallback = true;\\\").replace(\\\"      search.set('game.detail', info ? '0.08' : fallback ? '0.16' : '1');\\\", \\\"      if(\"'!search.has('\"'game.detail'))search.set('game.detail', info ? '0.08' : fallback ? '0.16' : '1');\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('tests/game/page.mjs');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"Math.abs(window.__engine.state('campaign').settings['game.wear.perShot'] - 0.0012) < 1e-10\\\", \\\"Math.abs(window.__game.context.frame.setting('game.wear.perShot') - 0.0012) < 1e-10\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nrg -n 'settings.*snapshot|defaults|\\\\.default' engine/core/settings.ts | tail -15\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Current acceptance results\n- Page tier reached 77 passed / 3 failed. The remaining cases were the reset check reading the engine's sparse overrides instead of its setting getter, the Back glyph colliding with the movement action named back, and a too-short virtual pad pulse during a GPU scene restart. Corrected the getter test and glyph routing; the pad pulse now spans the software-renderer transition.\n- A held native action requires an explicit check.signals entry. Added it to the drive/map-hold actions after the opening probe caught the schema rejection. Future dependent build/test shell commands use set -e.\n- Latest page rerun is exec session 84066 (golden regenerated, bundle built). Wait for it before starting other browsers.\n- Co-op now resets all simulation tuning, cheats, movement overrides and input modes to a shared preset. Camera, audio and other presentation preferences remain local. Fixed bled-out players being able to move/revive; a probe confirms down=-1 and moved=0.\n- Vehicle wheels now spin/steer with suspension travel; drive pose holds until exit. Buddy NPCs now use real guns during rescue and alternate-plan accompaniment.\n- Still required before finish: green sim/page tiers, actual hub harness + standalone tabs/RTC, static check, final acceptance, final interview counts and rebundle. Do not claim these passed yet.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
