{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_235","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"head -75 out/check.log\nrg -n 'meleeUntil|spreadOf|noiseRadius|recoilStep|if \\\\(s &&' labs/game/scenes/arms.ts\nrg -n 'b: d|game.move.sprint|devPage' labs/game/bot.ts labs/game/ui/settings.ts\nwc -l labs/game/scenes/arms.ts labs/game/main.ts labs/game/scenes/save.ts\nset -e\nnode --import tsx out/golden.mts\nNODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=1800 node tests/game/verify.mjs sim\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_236","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '195,237p' labs/game/scenes/arms.ts\nsed -n '237,247p' labs/game/scenes/arms.ts\nsed -n '280,309p' labs/game/scenes/story.ts\nsed -n '88,110p' labs/game/ui/settings.ts\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_236","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '195,237p' labs/game/scenes/arms.ts\nsed -n '237,247p' labs/game/scenes/arms.ts\nsed -n '280,309p' labs/game/scenes/story.ts\nsed -n '88,110p' labs/game/ui/settings.ts\"","aggregated_output":"  }\n  const hit = physicsOf(w).raycast(from, dir, {\n    maxDistance: g.kind === 'flame' ? 17 : kind.range,\n    groups: ['world', 'prop', 'actor', 'crowd', 'flyer', 'corpse'],\n    exclude: p.actor.body,\n  });\n  const to: [number, number, number] = hit\n    ? [hit.point.x, hit.point.y, hit.point.z]\n    : [from[0] + dir[0] * kind.range, from[1] + dir[1] * kind.range, from[2] + dir[2] * kind.range];\n  let target = hit ? entityOfBody(w, hit.body) : -1;\n  if (hit && target < 0) {\n    const rag = [...w.query('ragdoll' as never)].find((e) =>\n      (e as unknown as { ragdoll: { bodies: number[] } }).ragdoll.bodies.includes(hit.body),\n    );\n    if (rag) target = rag.id;\n  }\n  const struck = target >= 0 ? w.get(target) : undefined;\n  let counted = false;\n  if (\n    struck?.health &&\n    struck.health.hp > 0 &&\n    (!struck.seat || !cheat(w, 'god')) &&\n    !(p.soldier && campaign(w).buddies.some((b) => b.entity === target && b.fallen > 0))\n  ) {\n    const head = to[1] > (struck.actor?.y ?? 0) + 1.45,\n      amount = g.damage * (head ? 2.5 : 1) * (p.seat ? value(w, 'damage.player') : value(w, 'damage.enemy'));\n    damage(\n      w,\n      { id: target, health: struck.health },\n      { amount: cheat(w, 'oneShot') && p.seat ? 999 : amount, from, at: to, source: p.id },\n    );\n    W.hits++;\n    counted = true;\n  }\n  if (hit) for (const r of w.query('ride')) if (r.ride.data.body === hit.body) r.ride.data.hp -= g.damage;\n  w.emit('gunshot', {\n    id: p.id,\n    weapon: kind.id,\n    from,\n    to,\n    normal: hit ? [hit.normal.x, hit.normal.y, hit.normal.z] : null,\n    body: hit?.body ?? -1,\n    target,\n    target,\n    hit: counted,\n  });\n  if (p.seat) {\n    campaign(w).flags.noise = w.tick;\n    campaign(w).flags.noiseX = p.actor.x;\n    campaign(w).flags.noiseZ = p.actor.z;\n  }\n}\nexport function arms(w: GW): void {\n  for (const p of people(w)) {\n  }\n  const at = step.at,\n    near = at && players(w).some((p) => Math.hypot(p.actor.x - at[0], p.actor.z - at[1]) < (step.radius ?? 30));\n  let done =\n    step.kind === 'at'\n      ? near\n      : step.kind === 'talk'\n        ? c.flags[`talk:${step.key}`] > 0\n        : step.kind === 'use'\n          ? c.flags[`use:${step.key}`] > 0\n          : step.kind === 'coverage'\n            ? (c.coverage[step.key!] ?? 0) > 0\n            : step.kind === 'flag'\n              ? (c.flags[step.key!] ?? 0) > 0\n              : step.kind === 'burn'\n                ? burning(w, at!, step.radius!) >= (step.count ?? 8)\n                : step.kind === 'delivery'\n                  ? (c.flags.deliveries ?? 0) >= (step.count ?? 3)\n                  : step.kind === 'clear'\n                    ? c.cleared[step.key!] !== undefined\n                    : step.kind === 'vehicle'\n                      ? players(w).some(\n                          (p) => p.seat!.data.vehicle >= 0 && w.get(p.seat!.data.vehicle)?.ride?.data.kind === step.key,\n                        )\n                      : false;\n  if (\n    done &&\n    c.flags[`alt-${c.contract}`] &&\n    c.step === contract.steps.length - 1 &&\n    !c.flags[`altDone-${c.contract}`] &&\n      ['ambience', 'Ambience'],\n    ] as const)\n      slider(root, label, audio.volume(bus), 0, 1, 0.01, (v) => {\n        audio.volume(bus, v);\n        if (bus === 'ui') setVoiceVolume(v);\n        store.set(`audio.${bus}`, v);\n      });\n  } else if (settingsPage === 1) {\n    picker(root, 'Button glyphs', ['PlayStation', 'Xbox'], ctx.glyphs, (v) => {\n      ctx.glyphs = v;\n      store.set('glyphs', v);\n      refreshGlyphs(ctx);\n    });\n    slider(root, 'Mouse sensitivity', store.get('input.sensitivity', 1), 0.1, 3, 0.1, (v) =>\n      live('input.sensitivity', v),\n    );\n    slider(root, 'Stick sensitivity', store.get('input.stickSensitivity', 1), 0.1, 3, 0.1, (v) =>\n      live('input.stickSensitivity', v),\n    );\n    picker(root, 'Invert look', ['Off', 'On'], store.get('input.invert', false) ? 'On' : 'Off', (v) => {\n      live('input.invert', v === 'On');\n      live('input.stickInvert', v === 'On');\n    });\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_237","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/arms.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"  let counted = false;\\\", \\\"  let counted = false;\\\\n  if(struck?.sceneProp)strikeEntity(w,target,from,true,'shot');\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"    campaign(w).flags.noiseZ = p.actor.z;\\\", \\\"    campaign(w).flags.noiseZ = p.actor.z;campaign(w).flags.noiseRadius=gs.key==='whisper'?25:120;\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"if (g.kind === 'flare' || g.kind === 'rocket') launch(w, p, g.kind, yaw, pitch, g.damage);\\\", \\\"if (g.kind === 'flare' || g.kind === 'rocket') launch(w, p, g.kind, yaw, pitch, g.damage*(p.seat?value(w,'damage.player'):value(w,'damage.enemy')));\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"    struck?.health &&\\\", \\\"    g.kind\"'!=='\"'rocket'&&g.kind\"'!=='\"'flare'&&struck?.health &&\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"(head ? 2.5 : 1)\\\", \\\"(head ? 2.5 : to[1]<(struck.actor?.y??0)+0.85?0.7:1)\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('labs/game/scenes/save.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"if (p.seat.data.fever) p.seat.data.fever\\\", \\\"if (p.seat\"'!.data.fever) p.seat!.data.fever\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('\"'labs/game/scenes/melee.ts');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"      if (id >= 0 || \"'!t) return;\", \"      if(!t||![...w.query('\"'ragdoll' as never)].some(e=>e.id===t.id&&(e as unknown as {ragdoll:{bodies:number[]}}).ragdoll.bodies.includes(hit.body)))return;\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Latest source changes and active run\n- Browser milestone remains 80/80 on the prior packaged build. Several subsequent source fixes need page validation after rebundling.\n- Current CPU tier is exec session 12784 (opening golden regenerated, then \"'`verify sim`). Do not run a browser concurrently with this suite; memory is shared with other jobs.\n- Added compact save support for the original seed, car/boat positions and HP, carried supplies/cargo attachments, buddy positions/health and permanent death, plus remaining timers. Save tests use the `snapshot` action and `gameSave` component rather than a huge engine capture.\n- Added actual pickup/boat cargo loading and clinic unloading, real delayed machete strikes/blade animation, grenade selection/fuse/bounce, mouse-wheel weapon selection, recoil/spread metadata, corpse ray hits/mercy, and breakable strikes.\n- Expanded live movement sliders. The travel bot temporarily raises sprint speed for physical travel through Receipts and restores it afterwards; balance combat remains a separate concern. Burn regrowth default is now 180 game minutes (three real minutes) to prevent regrowth under an active fire front; the short regrowth test explicitly uses 18.\n- All four alternate plans now have world objectives: radio hut, fourth crate, engineer escort, boat fuel. Briefings are actually shown. Added the ladder to the mine ropeway. Fixed all-buddies-dead story progression.\n- Title/attract now reuse their simulation through the mode action instead of rebuilding the GPU stage on every input. This avoids repeated shader allocations. Attract no longer interrupts in-game pause menus or a waiting network lobby.\n- Co-op uses shared presets, unique seat positions, safe bleed-out behavior, network pause/quit flow and host-disconnect signals. Embedded hub uses Settings only; standalone co-op offers a leave path. Story-only people/beds are excluded from Contract Run interaction.\n- Most recent static check had only an unused strikeEntity import and save Seat optionality errors; these have been corrected in source. Run format/check again before final acceptance.\n- Remaining priorities: green sim suite; actual hub harness + standalone transport tests; final page and final acceptance; inspect remaining viewport PNGs; concrete testing issue counts in interview writer, regenerate JSON and rebuild. No engine changes, no subagents, no dependency additions.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
