{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_242","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('labs/game/bot.ts');s=p.read_text().replace('move: d > 1 ?', 'move: d > 0.1 ?');p.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport os,pathlib,signal\nroot=os.getcwd();targets=[]\nfor d in pathlib.Path('/proc').iterdir():\n if not d.name.isdecimal():continue\n try:\n  if os.readlink(d/'cwd')\"'!=root:continue\n  cmd=(d/'\"'cmdline').read_bytes().replace(b'\\\\0',b' ').decode(errors='replace')\n  if 'tests/game/verify.mjs sim' in cmd and cmd.startswith('node '):targets.append(int(d.name))\n except OSError:pass\n# Only the verified test runner's descendants are stopped.\nchildren={}\nfor d in pathlib.Path('/proc').iterdir():\n if not d.name.isdecimal():continue\n try:\n  ppid=int(next(l for l in (d/'status').read_text().splitlines() if l.startswith('PPid:')).split()[1]);children.setdefault(ppid,[]).append(int(d.name))\n except (OSError,ValueError,StopIteration):pass\ndef stop(pid):\n for child in children.get(pid,[]):stop(child)\n try:os.kill(pid,signal.SIGTERM)\n except ProcessLookupError:pass\nfor pid in targets:print('Restarting obsolete simulation runner',pid);stop(pid)\nPY\nset -e\nnode --import tsx out/golden.mts\nNODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=1800 node tests/game/verify.mjs sim\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_243","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> labs/game/README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Calls made while building\n\nThe original title came from a cryptographic random pick among fifty candidates; the evidence is in \"'`out/title-pick.json`. The world retains all fourteen planned places, seven story chapters, twelve guns, three buddies, six tapes and eight stone caches.\n\nBurn regrowth is tuned to 180 game minutes by default (three minutes of real play at the default day rate). The shorter initial value could regrow fuel beneath an active fire; the longer interval leaves useful scars and ends individual fronts. The slider and Regrow tool remain live. Automated travel through the opening and Receipts raises sprint speed to shorten the headless run, then restores it; combat/balance checks use normal settings.\n\nMedical moments use native full-body actions and visible tool props because the engine'\"'s first-person arm rig is closed. The paper map uses a diegetic SVG/CSS layer, with a controller pencil, waypoint marks and zoom. It never pauses the world. Title/attract mode reuse their simulation to avoid rebuilding the GPU stage each time a visitor presses a button. A waiting network lobby keeps its crew rather than being interrupted by the idle director.\n\nSaves are small game records: seed, inventory, relationships, objective flags, burn runs, supplies and vehicles. A restored driver stands safely beside the saved vehicle. A dead buddy stays dead after a load. No full engine capture is used for persistence or networking.\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Active verification after final core fixes\n- Restarted the stale CPU runner after finding a bot dead zone: botIntents stopped within 1 m while useKey required 0.35 m. It now moves down to 0.1 m. New sim run is exec session 1235; no browser should run concurrently.\n- Latest golden is being regenerated by that command before the sim tier. The preceding run's hash was 99be6c2442c76215, superseded if this regeneration changes it.\n- Current source has cargo attachment/clinic unloading and an extended compact Save format. Added tests for saved vehicles/original seed/dead buddy, cargo loading and final bleed-out.\n- Added real machete blade/attack timing, corpse/mercy ray mapping, public breakable strikes, normal weapon spread/recoil, suppressor noise distance and mouse-wheel slots. All network button presses now latch until sent; menu presses are excluded.\n- Current static cleanup: strikeEntity is now actually used; p.seat optionality in save load was corrected. Run format/check again after sim fixes.\n- Page last achieved 80/80, but later source changes still need rebundle/page/final checks. Real hub harness and standalone tabs/RTC are still unrun and must be completed.\nEOF\nhead -5 out/test/verify.json\nwc -l labs/game/README.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_243","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> labs/game/README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Calls made while building\n\nThe original title came from a cryptographic random pick among fifty candidates; the evidence is in \"'`out/title-pick.json`. The world retains all fourteen planned places, seven story chapters, twelve guns, three buddies, six tapes and eight stone caches.\n\nBurn regrowth is tuned to 180 game minutes by default (three minutes of real play at the default day rate). The shorter initial value could regrow fuel beneath an active fire; the longer interval leaves useful scars and ends individual fronts. The slider and Regrow tool remain live. Automated travel through the opening and Receipts raises sprint speed to shorten the headless run, then restores it; combat/balance checks use normal settings.\n\nMedical moments use native full-body actions and visible tool props because the engine'\"'s first-person arm rig is closed. The paper map uses a diegetic SVG/CSS layer, with a controller pencil, waypoint marks and zoom. It never pauses the world. Title/attract mode reuse their simulation to avoid rebuilding the GPU stage each time a visitor presses a button. A waiting network lobby keeps its crew rather than being interrupted by the idle director.\n\nSaves are small game records: seed, inventory, relationships, objective flags, burn runs, supplies and vehicles. A restored driver stands safely beside the saved vehicle. A dead buddy stays dead after a load. No full engine capture is used for persistence or networking.\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Active verification after final core fixes\n- Restarted the stale CPU runner after finding a bot dead zone: botIntents stopped within 1 m while useKey required 0.35 m. It now moves down to 0.1 m. New sim run is exec session 1235; no browser should run concurrently.\n- Latest golden is being regenerated by that command before the sim tier. The preceding run's hash was 99be6c2442c76215, superseded if this regeneration changes it.\n- Current source has cargo attachment/clinic unloading and an extended compact Save format. Added tests for saved vehicles/original seed/dead buddy, cargo loading and final bleed-out.\n- Added real machete blade/attack timing, corpse/mercy ray mapping, public breakable strikes, normal weapon spread/recoil, suppressor noise distance and mouse-wheel slots. All network button presses now latch until sent; menu presses are excluded.\n- Current static cleanup: strikeEntity is now actually used; p.seat optionality in save load was corrected. Run format/check again after sim fixes.\n- Page last achieved 80/80, but later source changes still need rebundle/page/final checks. Real hub harness and standalone tabs/RTC are still unrun and must be completed.\nEOF\nhead -5 out/test/verify.json\nwc -l labs/game/README.md\"","aggregated_output":"{\"numTotalTestSuites\":2,\"numPassedTestSuites\":0,\"numFailedTestSuites\":2,\"numPendingTestSuites\":0,\"numTotalTests\":15,\"numPassedTests\":8,\"numFailedTests\":7,\"numPendingTests\":0,\"numTodoTests\":0,\"snapshot\":{\"added\":0,\"failure\":false,\"filesAdded\":0,\"filesRemoved\":0,\"filesRemovedList\":[],\"filesUnmatched\":0,\"filesUpdated\":0,\"matched\":0,\"total\":0,\"unchecked\":0,\"uncheckedKeysByFile\":[],\"unmatched\":0,\"updated\":0,\"didUpdate\":false},\"startTime\":1793891884152,\"success\":false,\"testResults\":[{\"assertionResults\":[{\"ancestorTitles\":[\"the basin\"],\"fullName\":\"the basin replays its recorded opening to the golden hashes\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"title\":\"replays its recorded opening to the golden hashes\",\"duration\":1200.1949960000002,\"failureMessages\":[],\"meta\":{},\"tags\":[]},{\"ancestorTitles\":[\"the basin\"],\"fullName\":\"the basin captures and restores a moving seat without shared state\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"title\":\"captures and restores a moving seat without shared state\",\"duration\":3812.507178,\"